    "Ceritinib may alter H3K27me2K36me2 and related H3K27 methylation states through ALK/RTK-dependent chromatin remodeling, and kinase inhibitors with high anchor similarity such as crizotinib, regorafenib, sorafenib, ibrutinib, or cyclosporine may share this histone perturbation signature.",
